OL,3,A'Every day there is killing': Gazans
OL,4,Aface Israeli strikes despite ceasefire
OL,5,Aas peace deal stalls
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn her tent in central Gaza early one
OL,8,Fmorning last month, 31-year-old Fida
OL,9,Fal-Toutah, a mother of five, was
OL,10,Fcombing her daughter's hair when the
OL,11,Fsound of gunfire erupted.
OL,13,F"My mother shouted at us to get down,"
OL,14,Fher son Ezz recalled, weeping as he
OL,15,Fspoke.
OL,17,FHe only realised Fida had been hit when
OL,18,Fhe saw the bloodied hands of his
OL,19,Fyounger brother, who had been clinging
OL,20,Fonto his mother as the bullets came in.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
